# TUNINGS 12 / rhythmic polyphony before the final forest.
# Each expression owns its tuning; all share 96 BPM. LOOP repeats the full combined score.
# Scale-degree pitches are n values; apostrophe n is a note duration.
!b96 !sa
bass=(uJMI o55 s[n1 ~ 5 ~ 1 3 ~ 5]v1e0254'n8p-0.65r2)
line=(uPTH o110 t[n1 3 [5 6 7] 8]f3>7'4v0.8e0254'n4p-0.2r3)
shine=(uHEX o220 a[n1 3 ~ 5 6 ~]f4>7'4h0.4>3'4v0.35e0254'n8p0.3r2)
cloud=(uBPJ o110 q[n1 ~ 4 7 ~ 9]f4v0.3e0254'b1/3p0.7r3)
bass line shine cloud
